#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kspell; is the spelling checker used by &kde; applications such as &kate;, "
"&kmail;, and &kword;. It is a &GUI; frontend to <application>"
"International ISpell</application> and <application>ASpell</application>."
msgstr ""
"&kspell; é o verificador ortográfico usado polos programas de &kde; tais como &kate;, "
"&kmail; e kword;. É unha interface gráfica para <application>International "
"ISpell</application> e <application>ASpell</application>."

